  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Seminarium (1 vecka) om politiskt ansvar i en demokrati f&#xF6;r 20 unga politiker fr&#xE5;n Archangelsk-regionen. Syftet &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rmedla en grundl&#xE4;ggande kunskap om hur det svenska politiska sytemet fungerar. Svensk genomf&#xF6;rande part &#xE4;r Academic Development International.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to give 20 young politicians in the Arkhangelsk region a basic knowledge of the swedish political system through a one-week seminar in Arkhangelsk. Swedish counterpart is Academic Development International.</narrative>
  </description>
